These patches add DVC support to Renesas sound driver.
DVC is one of feature of CMD unit, it can control sound Volume.

Kuninori Morimoto (5):
      ASoC: rsnd: add rsnd_path_parse() macro
      ASoC: rsnd: add rsnd_get_adinr()
